<Prose title="Cookie policy" desc="GovPulse uses no cookies for browsing and no consent banner is needed. Learn why and what changes if accounts launch." template>
<h2>We do not use cookies</h2><p>Browsing GovPulse sets no cookies, uses no localStorage identifiers and loads no third-party trackers. That is why there is no cookie banner: under the ePrivacy Directive and GDPR, consent is required for non-essential storage on your device, and we do not do any.</p>
<h2>Analytics</h2><p>If enabled, we use <a href="https://www.cloudflare.com/web-analytics/">Cloudflare Web Analytics</a>, which works without cookies and without fingerprinting, measuring page views in aggregate only.</p>
<h2>If this changes</h2><p>When sign-in for paid plans launches, a strictly necessary session cookie will be used to keep you signed in. Strictly necessary cookies do not require consent, but this page will list them. If we ever add non-essential cookies, we will ask for consent first with an equal "Reject" option.</p>
</Prose>
